  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.61 Vinyl or urethane substrate coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.61 \"Vinyl or urethane substrate coating\" means a decorative, protective, or functional coating or ink that is applied to vinyl or urethane substrates, including vinyl or urethane coated fabric.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
